摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"DeepSeek Harness Android app: control your DeepSeek Harness agents from your phone. The agent runs on your PC; a host plugin inside DSH pairs the phone by QR code over Wi-Fi or Tailscale, no cloud. Chats of all projects, live replies, photos and files, steer, agent questions, not","id":"gh:1404727830","install_available":false,"language":"Kotlin","name":"dsh-mobile","slug":"pavel-logachev/dsh-mobile","topics":["agent-harness","agentic-ai","ai-agent","ai-agents","ai-coding-agent","android","android-app","coding-agent","deepseek","deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","jetpack-compose","kotlin","local-first","mobile-app","open-source","remote-control","self-hosted","tailscale"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"DeepSeek Harness Android app: control your DeepSeek Harness agents from your phone. The agent runs o"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"n your PC; a host plugin inside DSH pairs the phone by QR code over Wi-Fi or Tailscale, no cloud. Ch"},{"id":"p1s3","text":"ats of all projects, live replies, photos and files, steer, agent questions, not"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# DSH Mobile"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"Case study on the website: <https://logachev.net/#case-dsh-mobile> · Technical write-ups (in Russian"},{"id":"p3s2","text":") on Habr: the plugin and pairing, task notifications without Google push"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"[](https://github.com/pavel-logachev/dsh-mobile/releases/latest) [](https://github.com/pavel-logache"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"v/dsh-mobile/actions/workflows/ci.yml) [](<LICENSE>)"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"English | Русский"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"**Your DeepSeek Harness agent runs on your computer. From your Android phone you assign tasks with p"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"hotos and files, read replies in real time, answer the agent's questions and get an “Answer ready” n"},{"id":"p6s3","text":"s, read replies in real time, answer the agent's questions and get an “Answer ready” notification.**"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"Download 0.9.3 · Release notes · Installation · Architecture · Security"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"> An unofficial project by Pavel Logachev. Developed independently of DeepSeek."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"Android 8.0+ · QR code pairing · Wi‑Fi or Tailscale"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"Models, tools and subscriptions stay on the computer. DSH Mobile has no cloud server."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"## What's new in 0.9.x"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"The current release is **0.9.3** (8 November 2026): app 0.9.3 (versionCode 20) and companion plugin "},{"id":"p12s2","text":"0.9.3. The relay has not changed since 0.9.2. Upgrade the app and the plugin together."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"**0.9.3**"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"- The \"Waiting for the task result\" notification now also clears when a task fails or you stop it. A"},{"id":"p14s2","text":" stop you make yourself clears it silently, without an error alert.\n- Fixed a \"No connection\" hang s"},{"id":"p14s3","text":"een on Android 17: the app could treat itself as hidden while it was open, and \"Reconnect\" did nothi"},{"id":"p14s4","text":"ng until restart. \"Reconnect\" now always starts a fresh round of attempts, even after automatic retr"},{"id":"p14s5","text":"ies ran out.\n- The chat no longer jumps while you send a message or the reply is streaming.\n- A new "},{"id":"p14s6","text":"\"Working now\" section at the top of the chat list shows chats with a running task, running subagents"},{"id":"p14s7","text":" or a question waiting for you.\n- After Stop, the \"Sending…\" card disappears as soon as the computer"},{"id":"p14s8","text":" confirms the stop. Previously it stayed for 1–2 minutes.\n- Chat search matches only your messages a"},{"id":"p14s9","text":"nd the agent's replies. The app explains why it needs notifications before the first system prompt."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"**0.9.2 and 0.9.1**"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"- Removing a task from the queue ends its watch with the `rejected` status instead of a stuck \"Waiti"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"ng for the result\".\n- Image sending is fixed, including large photos through a relay. Attachment upl"},{"id":"p16s3","text":"oads get a 120 s timeout, and HEIF/HEIC photos are converted to JPEG on Android 9+.\n- Your answer to"},{"id":"p16s4","text":" an agent question is kept after a DSH restart. Removing a message from the queue no longer shows a "},{"id":"p16s5","text":"estion is kept after a DSH restart. Removing a message from the queue no longer shows a false error."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"**0.9.0**"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"## Security"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"- **Agent permissions stay the same.** The plugin runs inside DSH with its permissions. Project filt"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"ering is not a sandbox: an agent can do the same from the phone as from the computer. Give the right"},{"id":"p20s3","text":" to run tasks only to trusted devices.\n- **The invitation is a secret.** The QR code is single-use a"},{"id":"p20s4","text":"nd valid for no more than 15 minutes. Do not publish it, send it to a chat or save it in shared logs"},{"id":"p20s5","text":". Pairing checks the computer's certificate, its validity period, the address and the pinned fingerp"},{"id":"p20s6","text":"rint.\n- **Provider keys are not sent to the phone.** Pairing data is protected by Android Keystore a"},{"id":"p20s7","text":"nd excluded from backups. The plugin's private files on Windows are accessible only to the owner of "},{"id":"p20s8","text":"the user account.\n- **Revoke a lost phone on the computer.** Signing out of the app locally deletes "},{"id":"p20s9","text":"the pairing data from the phone but does not revoke access on the DSH side.\n- **Notifications do not"},{"id":"p20s10","text":" contain the completed answer.** Failure alerts may include a short summary; lock-screen content is "},{"id":"p20s11","text":"private. Chat names use a localized fallback without fetching a transcript. Details.\n- **The relay d"},{"id":"p20s12","text":"oes not see chat contents.** It forwards encrypted traffic but sees IP addresses, timing and the amo"},{"id":"p20s13","text":"unt of data transferred."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"Do not expose the DSH web port to the outside and do not disable TLS verification. Details are in th"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"e security overview."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"## Limitations"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"- **The computer and DSH must stay on.** The phone does not run an agent. One pairing targets one co"},{"id":"p23s2","text":"mputer; the project list considers the first 100 registered projects.\n- **This is intentionally a na"},{"id":"p23s3","text":"tive subset, not desktop parity.** Plugin/skill management is not exposed. Action approvals stay on "},{"id":"p23s4","text":"the desktop because there is no verified plugin API for them; they are distinct from answerable agen"},{"id":"p23s5","text":"t questions.\n- **Known 0.9.3 limitations.** A very short task can finish before the waiting notifica"},{"id":"p23s6","text":"tion appears; the answer alert still arrives. Answers to agent questions are shown in a block after "},{"id":"p23s7","text":"all messages, not at their place in time. Details.\n- **Notifications are best effort, without FCM/Un"},{"id":"p23s8","text":"ifiedPush.** There is no idle service/permanent connection notification or coverage banner. A pendin"},{"id":"p23s9","text":"g phone task still uses an FGS: its notification cannot be guaranteed invisible on all OEMs. Valid w"},{"id":"p23s10","text":"atches/outbox restore after process death and unlocked reboot subject to pairing, permission and OS "},{"id":"p23s11","text":"guards. After force-stop, launch the app manually. Doze, battery saving, offline devices, 24-hour ex"},{"id":"p23s12","text":"piry or eviction from the 32-watch bound can prevent delivery. Exact limits.\n- **Offline content is "},{"id":"p23s13","text":"a bounded stale/read-only cache.** At most 8 snapshots, 3500 KiB of serialized snapshot UTF-8, 24-ho"},{"id":"p23s14","text":"ur age, each snapshot at most 2 MiB; the index is bounded separately. Cache is not authorization, co"},{"id":"p23s15","text":"mmand reconciliation or a full archive. Fresh snapshots contain at most 100 messages/2 MiB; older-hi"},{"id":"p23s16","text":"story recovery is bounded to 16 pages/16 MiB. Upstream JSONL currently reads the whole log before th"},{"id":"p23s17","text":"ose limits apply.\n- **Updating DSH requires compatibility verification.** Setup may fill the version"},{"id":"p23s18","text":" from `dsh --version`; the runtime plugin checks the configured declaration, not the installed versi"},{"id":"p23s19","text":"on. Only the exact matrix entries are supported.\n[该节后续省略]"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
